[38;2;124;124;124mhyperbolic splitting.[0m

[38;2;124;124;124mThe set Λ = {p} ∪ {f^n(q) : n ∈ Z} where q is a transverse homoclinic point. [0m
[38;2;124;124;124mThis is compact (the orbit accumulates on p, so the closure adds p). It's f-[0m
