[38;2;124;124;124msince it's homoclinic).[0m

[38;2;124;124;124mIs {p} dense in Λ? No! Because q ∈ Λ but q ∉ closure({p}) = {p}.[0m

[38;2;124;124;124mSo periodic points are NOT dense in Λ.[0m

[38;2;124;124;124mThis is the classic example. The answer is YES.[0m

[38;2;124;124;124mLet me write this up properly.[0m

